WEBVTT

00:11.630 --> 00:13.630
- Prolouge -

00:20.980 --> 00:22.450
that we'd meet again...

00:26.530 --> 00:28.130
No matter what.

00:38.940 --> 00:40.700
We've got a test tomorrow, you know...

00:46.220 --> 00:47.360
Huh?

00:48.160 --> 00:49.350
Hey, Masato.

00:52.200 --> 00:53.160
Do you have my notebook?

00:53.160 --> 00:53.840
Notebook?

00:53.840 --> 00:56.750
I lent you my classic literature notes, didn't I?

00:57.640 --> 00:59.610
Oh, that?

00:59.610 --> 01:03.520
Sorry, I left it earlier in my desk in the classroom to preserve it.

01:03.520 --> 01:04.780
What the heck?!

01:04.780 --> 01:07.850
You're making it sound like you're fermenting it!

01:09.220 --> 01:10.390
I've got no choice.

01:10.390 --> 01:11.330
Where are you going?

01:11.330 --> 01:13.580
I'm going back to class to grab them.

01:13.580 --> 01:14.490
I'll go with you!

01:14.490 --> 01:16.460
It's fine, I'll go by myself.

01:16.460 --> 01:18.280
Riki...

01:18.280 --> 01:22.170
Are you telling me I can't come with you?

01:22.170 --> 01:23.240
Come on...

01:23.240 --> 01:26.250
Don't get so unexpectedly upset over it.

01:26.870 --> 01:29.200
I'll be all right, so go ahead and sleep.

01:39.540 --> 01:40.550
For some reason...

01:41.020 --> 01:43.550
it looks like a different world at night.

01:54.610 --> 01:56.440
Oh, it's just the trees.

01:59.460 --> 02:01.280
What are you doing in the school building at this hour?

02:02.200 --> 02:04.950
I-I came to get my notebook that I left behind!

02:04.950 --> 02:09.080
Run down the hallway and leave through the front emergency exit without looking back.

02:09.720 --> 02:12.420
Start running as soon as I let go, got it?

02:12.420 --> 02:13.630
Okay, go!

02:23.420 --> 02:24.930
What was that?

02:24.930 --> 02:26.700
Who was that?

02:27.680 --> 02:29.190
Oh right, my noteb—

02:31.140 --> 02:33.310
Was that... a gunshot?

02:34.770 --> 02:36.710
It couldn't have been...

02:48.250 --> 02:50.920
Student ID

02:51.500 --> 02:53.310
A student ID?

03:14.290 --> 03:21.080
Presented By Refrain Subs!

03:24.790 --> 03:30.690
Since being alone was tough, the two of us held hands.

03:31.210 --> 03:37.190
The of us two were lonely, so we all stood in a circle and joined hands.

03:37.170 --> 03:45.400
I'm sure that's where we will gather our strength.

03:45.340 --> 03:50.400
Enough to stand up to any dream.

03:50.250 --> 03:53.030
Fly high towards the sky,

03:52.670 --> 03:57.190
Kick off the ground and send your voice to the heavens,

03:56.880 --> 04:02.240
Until you overcome those painful days.

04:02.000 --> 04:07.360
I'll never forget your voice, and I'll never forget your tears.

04:03.990 --> 04:04.030
The First Annual Make Kyousuke Chuckle Championships

04:07.000 --> 04:14.320
The future that we call "hope" begins now.

04:14.090 --> 04:25.110
Your feet will continue to step onward, even when the time of grief comes.

04:33.630 --> 04:34.980
Hm? Riki.

04:34.980 --> 04:37.520
Student ID

04:35.440 --> 04:36.300
What's that?

04:36.300 --> 04:37.520
A student ID.

04:37.520 --> 04:40.980
Name: Tokido Saya

04:37.520 --> 04:40.980
Class: 2-A

04:37.520 --> 04:39.410
I found it yesterday.

04:40.980 --> 04:46.240
Student ID

04:40.980 --> 04:42.640
"Tokido..."

04:42.640 --> 04:44.240
I think that's how you read it.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.360
Tokido?

04:45.360 --> 04:47.500
That's an uncommon surname.

04:49.130 --> 04:50.530
I'll go return it.

04:50.530 --> 04:53.300
She's in a different class, but we're in the same year.

04:53.300 --> 04:55.290
Oh, okay.

04:56.780 --> 04:58.160
Excuse me.

04:58.160 --> 05:00.420
Is there a "Tokido-san" here?

05:00.910 --> 05:02.860
If you're looking for Tokido-san...

05:02.860 --> 05:04.840
she's the girl right there in the middle.

05:09.760 --> 05:14.370
When I looked at the girl named Tokido Saya,

05:14.370 --> 05:16.670
nostalgia started welling up inside me.

05:17.930 --> 05:21.480
I've met this girl before.

05:21.890 --> 05:23.290
But...

05:23.290 --> 05:24.870
where?

05:25.440 --> 05:27.700
Do you have any business with Tokido-san?

05:27.700 --> 05:30.410
I found this, so can you return it to her?

05:30.410 --> 05:31.780
Hey, Tokido-san!

05:31.780 --> 05:32.830
Yeah, what is it?

05:32.830 --> 05:34.790
He says you dropped your ID.

05:52.470 --> 05:53.410
I'm Tokido.

05:53.410 --> 05:54.540
Um...

05:54.540 --> 05:55.930
I'm Naoe.

05:55.930 --> 05:57.810
You dropped this.

05:56.100 --> 05:56.230
Student ID

05:59.070 --> 06:00.410
Naoe-kun, huh?

06:00.410 --> 06:01.310
Thanks a lot.

06:02.970 --> 06:04.140
Later.

06:13.500 --> 06:16.250
She didn't seem to remember me from the past or anything...

06:16.250 --> 06:19.040
I guess that was actually the first time I'd met her.

06:24.460 --> 06:24.590
New mail | From: Unknown Sender

06:27.110 --> 06:29.400
"Thanks again for earlier."

06:29.400 --> 06:32.600
"I'll be waiting for you on
the rooftop during the next break."

06:32.600 --> 06:34.850
Tokido-san?

06:34.850 --> 06:37.930
How did she get my phone number?

06:37.930 --> 06:40.230
Thanks again for earlier.

06:37.930 --> 06:40.230
No Subject

06:37.930 --> 06:40.230
Unknown Sender

06:37.930 --> 06:40.230
I'll be waiting for you

06:37.930 --> 06:40.230
on the rooftop during the next break.

06:45.690 --> 06:51.660
Safety first

06:59.490 --> 07:01.840
H-Hello again—

07:01.840 --> 07:03.420
You're going to die.

07:03.420 --> 07:04.090
Eh?

07:04.090 --> 07:05.660
What'd you say just now?

07:05.660 --> 07:09.080
You're about to die a pitiful death.

07:09.080 --> 07:10.300
I'm going to die?

07:10.300 --> 07:11.620
Why's that...?

07:11.620 --> 07:12.390
That's right.

07:12.390 --> 07:15.840
Because you were wandering around the hallways at night.

07:16.680 --> 07:19.520
You'll probably be abducted tonight...

07:19.520 --> 07:21.640
by the Darkness Executives.

07:21.640 --> 07:22.690
Darkness Ex—

07:22.690 --> 07:23.660
What's that?

07:23.660 --> 07:25.730
Then they'll interrogate you,

07:25.730 --> 07:28.120
asking about whom you met in the corridor at night.

07:29.280 --> 07:31.780
Oh, so that was you back there.

07:31.780 --> 07:32.450
Eh?

07:32.450 --> 07:34.510
Don't tell me you didn't realize that?

07:34.510 --> 07:35.510
Huh?

07:35.510 --> 07:36.470
No.

07:36.470 --> 07:37.740
I screwed up...

07:37.740 --> 07:38.950
Um...

07:38.950 --> 07:39.750
Tokido-san?

07:40.400 --> 07:41.550
What...

07:41.550 --> 07:44.820
Yeah, yeah... I messed up and dug my own grave.

07:45.380 --> 07:46.260
It's stupid, right?!

07:46.260 --> 07:46.930
So stupid it's funny?!

07:46.930 --> 07:47.880
Go ahead and laugh!

07:47.880 --> 07:51.100
I'm not really sure what's
going on, but please calm down.

07:51.100 --> 07:54.490
Either way, the Darkness Executives are going to interrogate you

07:54.490 --> 07:57.120
and then they'll find out that I was with you back there.

07:57.120 --> 07:59.120
Like a hound dog trying to sniff you out.

07:59.120 --> 08:02.370
Like students who found out their
favorite restaurant just got a new item.

08:02.370 --> 08:03.100
Wait, um...

08:03.690 --> 08:04.310
That's why...

08:06.020 --> 08:08.900
you're going to die here.

08:09.290 --> 08:10.200
Right here.

08:10.200 --> 08:11.210
Eh?

08:15.450 --> 08:18.180
Game start!

08:27.830 --> 08:29.700
T-Tokido-san?

08:30.630 --> 08:32.620
This must be a misunderstanding!

08:32.620 --> 08:35.450
I'm not your enemy, I won't speak a word!

08:35.450 --> 08:37.920
You won't be able to resist when they drug you.

08:38.680 --> 08:40.960
Who would be using something like that?

08:40.960 --> 08:42.670
<i>The Darkness Executives.</i>

08:42.670 --> 08:43.850
I've never heard of them!

08:44.450 --> 08:46.310
Just be quiet and die already.

08:49.640 --> 08:50.550
Is that thing real?

08:50.550 --> 08:53.360
Why would I be carrying around a fake one?

08:54.950 --> 08:56.950
I can't hold on any longer.

08:59.470 --> 09:00.370
Riki!

09:00.950 --> 09:03.160
Oh, it really is you!

09:03.690 --> 09:05.850
Are you <i>rock climbing</i>?

09:05.850 --> 09:08.940
You're amazing, climbing all the way up there!

09:08.940 --> 09:11.980
Hold on, I’ll come join you up there.

09:11.980 --> 09:13.430
Masato...

09:16.460 --> 09:19.500
I'm counting on you to catch me.

09:33.260 --> 09:35.090
Yo, you're awake?

09:36.150 --> 09:37.900
You're not hurt, are you?

09:38.380 --> 09:40.560
That was a crazy catch.

09:40.560 --> 09:42.650
I wish someone would have seen it.

09:44.700 --> 09:45.960
Thanks, Masato.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.530
I knew I could count on you.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.750
Jeez...

09:49.750 --> 09:52.380
Why wasn't there anyone around to see it?

09:52.380 --> 09:54.130
How unlucky.

09:54.420 --> 09:56.640
Something like a <i>blessing in demise</i>.

09:56.640 --> 09:58.300
I was the lucky one.

09:58.300 --> 10:00.000
Oh, really?

10:00.000 --> 10:00.950
Then whatever.

10:00.950 --> 10:02.850
What matters is that you're safe.

10:02.850 --> 10:05.130
Yeah, thanks a lot.

10:06.750 --> 10:08.420
If Masato wasn't around...

10:08.420 --> 10:09.560
I probably would have died.

10:10.590 --> 10:12.770
Who are the Darkness Executives?

10:12.770 --> 10:15.910
What's with students trying to kill each other?

10:15.910 --> 10:20.240
And on top of that, the fence broke off with perfect timing.

10:21.820 --> 10:24.000
Game start!

10:26.560 --> 10:27.910
That's it...

10:32.550 --> 10:33.590
Kyousuke.

10:33.590 --> 10:34.380
Hm?

10:35.110 --> 10:38.080
Would you mind putting an end to this game?

10:38.630 --> 10:39.880
What are you talking about?

10:39.880 --> 10:42.870
This is all your doing, isn't it?

10:42.870 --> 10:46.170
Tokido-san, and the Darkness Executives.

10:47.370 --> 10:49.600
The Darkness Executives?

10:49.600 --> 10:51.750
Where did you hear that name?

10:51.750 --> 10:52.440
Eh?

10:52.440 --> 10:53.950
From Tokido-san.

10:53.950 --> 10:54.650
Riki.

10:55.870 --> 10:58.140
Don't ever speak of them again.

10:58.140 --> 10:58.690
Eh?

10:58.690 --> 11:02.620
Do the Darkness Executives really exist?

11:04.010 --> 11:07.500
Those guys are like my natural enemy.

11:07.500 --> 11:09.780
They're fully aware of my weakness.

11:09.780 --> 11:11.420
Your weakness?

11:11.420 --> 11:13.050
It's Rin's safety.

11:13.050 --> 11:14.230
That can't be...

11:14.230 --> 11:17.920
If I were to make a move, Rin would be endangered.

11:17.920 --> 11:21.220
Even I can’t do anything about them.

11:23.660 --> 11:24.340
Listen up.

11:24.340 --> 11:26.850
Don't get involved with them no matter what.

11:27.630 --> 11:30.960
Or... did something already happen?

11:30.960 --> 11:32.850
N-No...

11:32.850 --> 11:35.770
Don't worry, nothing happened.

11:43.940 --> 11:46.820
Kyousuke can't get Rin involved in all this.

11:47.580 --> 11:54.080
But can I really do anything by myself, without Kyousuke's help?

12:02.740 --> 12:06.790
You've come into contact with TK-010.

12:07.820 --> 12:10.790
Who is this TK-010?

12:22.170 --> 12:25.430
Were those the Darkness Executives?

12:44.940 --> 12:46.360
Thanks...

12:47.320 --> 12:48.650
Are you all right?

12:48.650 --> 12:51.180
That's in bad taste for a prank.

12:51.900 --> 12:53.870
If you weren't around I might have...

12:53.870 --> 12:54.480
Hm?

12:55.260 --> 12:57.810
There was someone behind the corner just now.

12:57.810 --> 12:59.220
What'd they look like?! A shadow?

12:59.220 --> 13:00.440
Or was it a girl?

13:00.930 --> 13:02.710
That's a strange question.

13:02.710 --> 13:04.710
But the answer to that would be <i>both</i>...

13:05.210 --> 13:09.410
Unless my eyes were deceiving me, it was probably a girl's shadow.

13:10.180 --> 13:13.080
There's no way Kengo's eyes could be wrong.

13:13.910 --> 13:15.470
It was Tokido Saya.

13:16.740 --> 13:19.260
She was trying to kill me again...

13:21.840 --> 13:23.980
and make it look like suicide.

13:30.800 --> 13:33.050
She's probably going to set up more traps.

13:35.670 --> 13:38.980
I might have coincidentally
been saved twice in a row...

13:38.980 --> 13:41.260
I can't expect a third miracle.

13:42.940 --> 13:45.210
I have to find her.

13:48.360 --> 13:51.630
The sun will be setting soon.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.400
I've gotta run away.

14:32.180 --> 14:33.670
Salt water!

14:33.670 --> 14:36.040
Getting soaked by this will increase conductivity.

14:38.660 --> 14:39.680
Think...

14:39.680 --> 14:41.080
Think of something...

14:41.080 --> 14:41.830
Anything...

14:46.840 --> 14:48.840
Take this!

15:07.290 --> 15:09.900
Riki-kun, you're quite amusing.

15:10.860 --> 15:14.580
I've decided against killing you.

15:15.210 --> 15:16.500
I wonder about that...

15:16.500 --> 15:21.290
You've survived three of my traps and proved your resilience.

15:21.290 --> 15:24.460
Two of those times were
because my friends saved me.

15:24.460 --> 15:27.250
I'm sure even that came from your own capability.

15:27.250 --> 15:30.440
Let's say you were born under a lucky star.

15:30.440 --> 15:31.930
A bearer of good fortune.

15:31.930 --> 15:35.290
It's a trait I could really use.

15:35.290 --> 15:36.810
What exactly is your point?

15:36.810 --> 15:38.970
How about you team up with me?

15:39.880 --> 15:41.940
Team up with someone who just tried to kill me?

15:41.940 --> 15:43.720
I'm in need of a partner.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.720
You're being shameless...

15:45.720 --> 15:47.380
If we break off negotiations here,

15:47.380 --> 15:52.160
you will most likely be captured by the Darkness Executives tonight.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.570
Or are you fine with that?

15:54.240 --> 15:55.560
What will you do?

15:55.560 --> 15:58.510
I doubt you'll be able to escape them by yourself.

15:58.510 --> 16:00.180
I’ll show you that I can!

16:00.950 --> 16:02.310
Is that so?

16:02.310 --> 16:04.750
Surprisingly, you're quite stubborn.

16:06.420 --> 16:08.710
Do the best you can...

16:11.280 --> 16:13.380
all by yourself.

16:17.700 --> 16:18.720
On second thought, I refuse!

16:18.720 --> 16:20.570
I have terrible luck!

16:20.570 --> 16:23.560
You could even go so far as saying I have the worst luck in the history of mankind!

16:23.560 --> 16:25.540
I need a lucky guy!

16:25.540 --> 16:26.270
Eh?

16:26.270 --> 16:27.860
Become my partner!

16:27.860 --> 16:28.900
I'll kill you if you don't!

16:28.900 --> 16:29.900
I'll kill you on the spot!

16:29.900 --> 16:31.080
I'll kill you in the meantime!

16:31.080 --> 16:32.990
Um, well...

16:38.810 --> 16:39.700
Wh—

16:39.700 --> 16:41.120
It's them!

16:41.120 --> 16:42.680
Stop standing around!

16:49.280 --> 16:50.300
Hurry!

16:54.500 --> 16:56.080
You get it now, don't you?

16:56.080 --> 16:59.250
You're being targeted by them now.

17:00.080 --> 17:02.520
You have no choice but to cooperate with me.

17:02.520 --> 17:04.800
T-That can't be.

17:10.090 --> 17:13.580
See? We need to team up.

17:14.890 --> 17:17.100
Um, what was your name again?

17:17.100 --> 17:18.780
You used it earlier, didn't you?

17:18.780 --> 17:20.270
It's Naoe Riki.

17:20.270 --> 17:21.540
All right, Riki-kun.

17:22.830 --> 17:25.830
First off, tell me exactly who you are.

17:27.580 --> 17:29.350
I'm an intelligence operative.

17:29.350 --> 17:30.840
In other words, a spy.

17:32.140 --> 17:35.210
Can I ask you not to inquire
which agency I'm affiliated with?

17:36.550 --> 17:38.970
Just tell me what your objective is.

17:38.970 --> 17:41.250
I appreciate your cooperation.

17:45.480 --> 17:49.340
My objective is the treasure hidden somewhere within this school.

17:49.340 --> 17:50.420
Treasure?

17:50.420 --> 17:53.560
Is there gold or something like
that buried under this school?

17:53.560 --> 17:55.740
It's not something as simple as gold or silver...

17:55.740 --> 17:57.700
It's a revolutionary treasure.

17:57.700 --> 18:00.570
I can't tell you the specifics yet, though.

18:00.570 --> 18:04.720
Were you walking around the corridors at night looking for this treasure?

18:04.720 --> 18:08.200
Who exactly are the Darkness Executives?

18:08.200 --> 18:11.320
They maintain the order of this school.

18:11.320 --> 18:17.010
If any problems were to arise, they
would deal with it behind the scenes.

18:17.010 --> 18:18.690
By any means necessary.

18:18.690 --> 18:20.410
Are they...

18:20.410 --> 18:21.800
...humans?

18:21.800 --> 18:26.490
They are said to be either
students or alumni of this school.

18:26.490 --> 18:28.770
Their actual bodies are somewhere else.

18:29.410 --> 18:31.440
Their bodies and shadows are separated?

18:32.140 --> 18:33.570
They're able to project their shadows.

18:34.200 --> 18:36.520
Can they really...?

18:39.450 --> 18:40.240
We're here.

18:40.240 --> 18:41.030
Eh?

18:41.030 --> 18:44.300
After searching for a while, I figured out the location.

18:47.300 --> 18:49.660
There should be an entrance
somewhere in this classroom.

18:49.660 --> 18:50.750
An entrance?

18:50.750 --> 18:53.460
The entrance to the underground of this school.

18:53.460 --> 18:54.340
Underground?

18:54.340 --> 18:56.650
But we're not on the first floor.

18:58.000 --> 19:02.580
I'll look for the entrance, so stall them for me in the meantime.

19:02.580 --> 19:03.260
Eh?

19:04.400 --> 19:05.260
Here.

19:05.260 --> 19:06.840
"Here..."?

19:06.840 --> 19:09.850
You're going to shoot them if they come.

19:09.850 --> 19:10.610
Eh?!

19:10.610 --> 19:11.730
No, no, no, no!

19:12.100 --> 19:13.230
You're my partner, aren't you?

19:13.230 --> 19:15.780
I-I wonder about that...

19:15.780 --> 19:17.510
It's kill or be killed.

19:18.690 --> 19:22.200
Hold it with both hands, aim at
your target and pull the trigger.

19:22.200 --> 19:24.720
It doesn't matter where you shoot them.

19:24.720 --> 19:27.620
Do I... have to shoot them?

19:27.620 --> 19:28.960
They're just shadows.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.600
Even if you shoot them, their bodies won't be injured.

19:31.600 --> 19:32.890
Well...

19:32.890 --> 19:33.710
But...

19:33.710 --> 19:35.300
I'm relying on you.

19:51.520 --> 19:53.280
The floor...

19:53.280 --> 19:54.480
sank?

19:59.400 --> 20:01.410
It's gotta be some kind of contraption.

20:01.410 --> 20:04.450
It must be used to hide the entrance to the treasure.

20:04.450 --> 20:09.080
This tile seems to have a different depth from this one over here...

20:10.080 --> 20:11.500
I wonder why...

20:13.040 --> 20:16.870
The depth differs depending on the location...

20:16.870 --> 20:19.130
Is the depth really different? Or is it...

20:21.850 --> 20:24.050
It stops sinking from this point.

20:24.870 --> 20:26.550
But it sinks over here...

20:26.550 --> 20:29.810
It seems like there are certain areas that sink.

20:29.810 --> 20:34.770
The outer tiles sink to the same depth when under the same pressure.

20:34.770 --> 20:38.520
While the tiles closer to the center require more force to sink to the same extent.

20:38.520 --> 20:42.760
So what can be done to evenly smooth out the floor?

20:42.760 --> 20:43.820
What is it?

20:43.820 --> 20:44.950
What are you talking about?

20:45.450 --> 20:47.000
A pyramid!

20:47.410 --> 20:48.950
What's the point of this?

20:48.950 --> 20:51.050
What are you planning on doing with a pyramid?

20:51.050 --> 20:52.660
This is the last one.

20:57.280 --> 20:58.520
There was a sound!

20:59.200 --> 21:01.120
It's coming from the blackboard in the back.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.130
Huh?

21:05.110 --> 21:05.930
They're here!

21:05.930 --> 21:07.080
Riki-kun, shoot them!

21:07.080 --> 21:08.090
Eh?!

21:08.090 --> 21:09.680
Start shooting!

21:24.680 --> 21:25.980
I found the entrance!

21:25.980 --> 21:26.950
Look out!

21:30.500 --> 21:31.620
Hurry up, Riki-kun!

21:45.690 --> 21:47.150
Riki-kun!

21:47.150 --> 21:48.640
It's inside this hole...

21:49.430 --> 21:51.050
The treasure!

21:51.520 --> 21:54.700
While I ran around the bases,

21:55.000 --> 21:58.300
I suddenly stopped in my tracks

21:58.400 --> 22:05.220
To gaze at the ball that flew above my head.

22:00.400 --> 22:04.900
Secret Agent Tokido Saya

22:05.290 --> 22:08.510
I wondered why

22:08.670 --> 22:11.900
I couldn’t even get that one hit,

22:12.140 --> 22:18.460
As I stood there bewildered.

22:18.760 --> 22:25.410
One point away, yet it feels so far.

22:20.520 --> 22:23.710
To the delicate eye.

22:25.590 --> 22:28.750
Don’t you feel that way too?

22:27.300 --> 22:30.710
Even if you feel like that.

22:29.100 --> 22:38.110
I wonder if I’ll be able to stand up to bat.

22:39.130 --> 22:41.950
But I know

22:42.000 --> 22:46.040
that my story from now on

22:46.070 --> 22:53.440
Is a journey for me to become as strong as you.

22:55.380 --> 23:00.110
This scene, where various ripples, forming and expanding,

22:59.710 --> 23:03.360
Are overlapping...

23:02.960 --> 23:10.100
You must not forget, these are everyone's feelings.

23:12.800 --> 23:16.600
As I look at you sitting next to me now

23:16.380 --> 23:25.590
You seem to be a little more mature.

23:30.990 --> 23:41.000
Episode 2

23:30.990 --> 23:41.000
The Two in the Labyrinth

23:32.860 --> 23:35.620
The underground labyrinth
is said to be a mystery.

23:35.620 --> 23:37.270
What is this contraption?

23:37.270 --> 23:40.000
Riki-kun, do something about it!
